Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.90,Narration,,0,0,0,,You prepare to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:02.58,Narration,,0,0,0,,Barcelona's wingers, and then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:03.74,Narration,,0,0,0,,their most dangerous winger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:04.80,Narration,,0,0,0,,turns up between your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.34,Narration,,0,0,0,,centre backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:07.32,Narration,,0,0,0,,Against Sevilla, Raphinha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,scored three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:09.52,Narration,,0,0,0,,A turn inside the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:10.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,box, a header,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:11.66,Narration,,0,0,0,,then a run behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:12.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,the defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:13.52,Narration,,0,0,0,,Three different problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:14.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,One player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:15.80,Narration,,0,0,0,,Hansi Flick has moved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,him into the middle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:18.10,Narration,,0,0,0,,and the consequences are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:18.94,Narration,,0,0,0,,getting ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:21.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,14 goals in eight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:22.00,Narration,,0,0,0,,competitive games.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,But this is bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:24.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,than a hot streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.08,Narration,,0,0,0,,It is about the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:26.62,Narration,,0,0,0,,decision Barcelona now force
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:27.92,Narration,,0,0,0,,every defender to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,After the Sevilla game,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:30.96,Narration,,0,0,0,,Shaka Hislop picked out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:31.88,Narration,,0,0,0,,what makes this role
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:32.56,Narration,,0,0,0,,so difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:36.64,Narration,,0,0,0,,The important word here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:37.16,Narration,,0,0,0,,is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:38.76,Narration,,0,0,0,,movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:40.76,Narration,,0,0,0,,Playing centrally does not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:41.84,Narration,,0,0,0,,mean Raphinha has to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:42.96,Narration,,0,0,0,,stand still and wrestle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:43.86,Narration,,0,0,0,,with two center backs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:44.76,Narration,,0,0,0,,for 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:45.88,Narration,,0,0,0,,It gives him a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:46.96,Narration,,0,0,0,,starting point from which
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:47.92,Narration,,0,0,0,,he can ask different
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:48.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:50.10,Narration,,0,0,0,,Come towards the ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:51.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,pin a defender for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,a moment, then disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:53.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,behind his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:55.20,Narration,,0,0,0,,Those movements draw on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:55.88,Narration,,0,0,0,,his experience of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.88,0:01:56.98,Narration,,0,0,0,,understanding the game from
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:57.74,Narration,,0,0,0,,wide areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:01:59.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,He can recognize the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:01:59.96,Narration,,0,0,0,,moment a defender turns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.96,0:02:00.82,Narration,,0,0,0,,to look at the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.34,0:02:01.96,Narration,,0,0,0,,That is the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:02.78,Narration,,0,0,0,,a run can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:04.30,Narration,,0,0,0,,Think about the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:05.70,Narration,,0,0,0,,Out wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:07.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,an attacker often has
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:07.98,Narration,,0,0,0,,to beat the defender
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:08.58,Narration,,0,0,0,,in front of him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:09.38,Narration,,0,0,0,,before he can threaten
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:09.74,Narration,,0,0,0,,the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.34,0:02:10.94,Narration,,0,0,0,,Through the middle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:12.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,one well -timed movement
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:13.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,can put him on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.14,0:02:13.78,Narration,,0,0,0,,the other side of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:14.62,Narration,,0,0,0,,the entire line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:16.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,Flick has not discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:17.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,that Raphinha is a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:18.04,Narration,,0,0,0,,good footballer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:19.28,Narration,,0,0,0,,We already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:20.22,Narration,,0,0,0,,He is changing where
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:21.38,Narration,,0,0,0,,those qualities hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:22.96,Narration,,0,0,0,,And that distinction matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:24.16,Narration,,0,0,0,,this is a mobile
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:26.06,Narration,,0,0,0,,central forward, not a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:26.86,Narration,,0,0,0,,tactical label that explains
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.86,0:02:28.12,Narration,,0,0,0,,itself, watch what he
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:29.12,Narration,,0,0,0,,does after taking up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:29.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,the position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:31.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,Imagine you are the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:32.68,Narration,,0,0,0,,center back, Raphinha comes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:34.12,Narration,,0,0,0,,short, follow him, and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:34.66,Narration,,0,0,0,,you may open a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.66,0:02:35.90,Narration,,0,0,0,,channel behind you, hold
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:36.94,Narration,,0,0,0,,your position, and he
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:37.90,Narration,,0,0,0,,may receive with enough
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:39.04,Narration,,0,0,0,,room to connect the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:40.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,Neither decision is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:41.32,Narration,,0,0,0,,automatically wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:42.66,Narration,,0,0,0,,The problem is making
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.66,0:02:43.74,Narration,,0,0,0,,it, while other players
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:44.74,Narration,,0,0,0,,are moving around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:46.16,Narration,,0,0,0,,Now put Lamine Yamal on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:48.04,Narration,,0,0,0,,If your team sends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:49.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,another defender towards him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:50.64,Narration,,0,0,0,,an inside space can open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:52.58,Narration,,0,0,0,,Raphinha can attack that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:53.66,Narration,,0,0,0,,space before the defense
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:54.84,Narration,,0,0,0,,reconnects.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:55.58,Narration,,0,0,0,,If you protect the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:56.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,middle instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:57.64,Narration,,0,0,0,,Yamal gets more freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:58.66,Narration,,0,0,0,,to choose the delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.16,Narration,,0,0,0,,Barcelona do not need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:01.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,the same pass every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:02.64,Narration,,0,0,0,,Pedri can find the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:03.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,run from midfield,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:04.82,Narration,,0,0,0,,Yamal can release it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:05.38,Narration,,0,0,0,,from the flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:07.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,A combination can change
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:08.22,Narration,,0,0,0,,the angle just as
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.22,0:03:09.16,Narration,,0,0,0,,the defender thinks he
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:09.92,Narration,,0,0,0,,has closed the lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:10.92,Narration,,0,0,0,,That is why the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:12.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,partnership matters more than
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.26,0:03:13.20,Narration,,0,0,0,,the formation on the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:13.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,team sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:14.70,Narration,,0,0,0,,The runner needs someone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:15.82,Narration,,0,0,0,,who sees him, the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:16.84,Narration,,0,0,0,,passer needs someone who
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:18.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,moves before the opening
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.10,Narration,,0,0,0,,becomes obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:20.76,Narration,,0,0,0,,When those two decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:22.30,Narration,,0,0,0,,happen together, a tiny
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.34,Narration,,0,0,0,,gap becomes a clear
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:23.78,Narration,,0,0,0,,chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:25.66,Narration,,0,0,0,,Earlier in September,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:27.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,Alejandro Moreno had already
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:28.72,Narration,,0,0,0,,spotted the same problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:26.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,gave us the clearest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:27.78,Narration,,0,0,0,,demonstration and it started
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:29.06,Narration,,0,0,0,,with Barcelona in trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:30.50,Narration,,0,0,0,,The home side scored
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:31.84,Narration,,0,0,0,,first their pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:33.50,Narration,,0,0,0,,disrupted Barcelona and the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:34.32,Narration,,0,0,0,,opening half was a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:35.92,Narration,,0,0,0,,contest Then Raphinha
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.32,Narration,,0,0,0,,answered from inside the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:38.98,Narration,,0,0,0,,penalty area Kristensen
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:40.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,found him, he escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:41.18,Narration,,0,0,0,,his marker with a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:41.78,Narration,,0,0,0,,clever turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:42.78,Narration,,0,0,0,,and finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,That is one version
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.10,Narration,,0,0,0,,of the central role.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.88,Narration,,0,0,0,,Receive under pressure and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:47.82,Narration,,0,0,0,,create the shooting angle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:48.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:50.44,Narration,,0,0,0,,After the break came
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:51.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,a different answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:52.50,Narration,,0,0,0,,Yamal delivered,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:53.86,Narration,,0,0,0,,and Raphinha got to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:54.80,Narration,,0,0,0,,the cross ahead of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:55.88,Narration,,0,0,0,,the defender to head
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:56.98,Narration,,0,0,0,,Barcelona in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.86,Narration,,0,0,0,,This time the decisive
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:05:00.06,Narration,,0,0,0,,skill was arriving at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.06,0:05:01.20,Narration,,0,0,0,,the destination first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:02.34,Narration,,0,0,0,,For the third,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:03.96,Narration,,0,0,0,,the attack moved through
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.00,Narration,,0,0,0,,Rodri to Yamal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:07.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,Raphinha ran beyond, received
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:08.50,Narration,,0,0,0,,the through ball and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,lifted the finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:11.84,Narration,,0,0,0,,Receive and turn, attack
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:13.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,the delivery, run behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:15.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,It is tempting to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,describe all three as
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:17.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,simply putting a winger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:17.78,Narration,,0,0,0,,up front,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:19.22,Narration,,0,0,0,,but that misses the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:19.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,variety.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:21.12,Narration,,0,0,0,,The defender has to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:22.04,Narration,,0,0,0,,solve a different problem
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,each time, and Raphinha
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:24.38,Narration,,0,0,0,,does not need to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:25.68,Narration,,0,0,0,,dominate every second of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:27.06,Narration,,0,0,0,,the match to decide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:28.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,He needs to recognize
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:29.30,Narration,,0,0,0,,the seconds that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:31.04,Narration,,0,0,0,,After that win, Barcelona
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.48,Narration,,0,0,0,,had taken all 21
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:34.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,available league points, 31
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:35.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,goals in seven games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:37.52,Narration,,0,0,0,,Raphinha had 12 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:38.84,Narration,,0,0,0,,That is an extraordinary
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:40.06,Narration,,0,0,0,,start, but the total
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:40.84,Narration,,0,0,0,,needs context.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:41.90,Narration,,0,0,0,,Three of his league
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:42.90,Narration,,0,0,0,,goals were penalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:44.10,Narration,,0,0,0,,A scoring rate like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:45.32,Narration,,0,0,0,,this should not be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:46.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,stretched across an entire
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:47.80,Narration,,0,0,0,,season and treated as
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:48.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:50.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,The stronger argument is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:51.52,Narration,,0,0,0,,the range of chances
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:52.66,Narration,,0,0,0,,this role can produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:53.72,Narration,,0,0,0,,You can have an
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.16,Narration,,0,0,0,,average finishing day and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:56.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,still make the same
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:56.76,Narration,,0,0,0,,intelligent run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.56,Narration,,0,0,0,,You can miss one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:00.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,delivery and attack the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.08,Narration,,0,0,0,,That is the part
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.34,Narration,,0,0,0,,opponents have to prepare for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:03.64,Narration,,0,0,0,,And for Real Madrid,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:04.90,Narration,,0,0,0,,the challenge has two
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:05.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:06.68,Narration,,0,0,0,,Keep collecting points,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:08.06,Narration,,0,0,0,,because Barcelona are setting
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.06,0:06:08.74,Narration,,0,0,0,,a fierce pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:09.82,Narration,,0,0,0,,Then find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.82,0:06:10.50,Narration,,0,0,0,,to defend the runner
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:11.58,Narration,,0,0,0,,without releasing the players
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:12.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,supplying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:13.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,Madrid had won five
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:14.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,of their opening six
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:15.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,league games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.74,0:06:16.50,Narration,,0,0,0,,So this is not
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:17.12,Narration,,0,0,0,,a race we can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:17.76,Narration,,0,0,0,,declare finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:18.76,Narration,,0,0,0,,It is pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:20.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,Every Barcelona win makes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,the next dropped point
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:22.08,Narration,,0,0,0,,more expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:23.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,Every different route to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:24.68,Narration,,0,0,0,,Raphinha makes the defensive
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:26.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,preparation more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:27.56,Narration,,0,0,0,,And earlier this month,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:29.22,Narration,,0,0,0,,Herculez Gomez put the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:30.00,Narration,,0,0,0,,challenge for the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:30.82,Narration,,0,0,0,,of the league in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:31.44,Narration,,0,0,0,,blunt terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:32.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:31.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,are answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:33.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,Keep the distances between
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,midfield and defense tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:36.54,Narration,,0,0,0,,Pressure the passer before
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:37.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,the run starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:39.28,Narration,,0,0,0,,Pass runners between
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:40.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,defenders instead of chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:41.32,Narration,,0,0,0,,them blindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,And when Barcelona commit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:43.94,Narration,,0,0,0,,players forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:45.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,use the space they
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.42,0:07:46.36,Narration,,0,0,0,,leave on a turnover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:48.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,Sevilla's first half showed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:49.12,Narration,,0,0,0,,that this team can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:49.66,Narration,,0,0,0,,be disrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:51.28,Narration,,0,0,0,,The experiment still has
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:52.24,Narration,,0,0,0,,to survive fatigue,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:54.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,tighter opponents, and days
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:55.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,when the finishing stops
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:56.14,Narration,,0,0,0,,looking effortless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.14,0:07:57.56,Narration,,0,0,0,,But that is what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.70,Narration,,0,0,0,,makes it worth watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:00.82,Narration,,0,0,0,,Raphinha is giving Barcelona
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:02.56,Narration,,0,0,0,,more ways to punish
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:03.60,Narration,,0,0,0,,the same defensive
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:04.26,Narration,,0,0,0,,hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:05.72,Narration,,0,0,0,,Whether this breaks La
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:06.90,Narration,,0,0,0,,Liga will be decided
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:07.56,Narration,,0,0,0,,over the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.18,0:08:08.80,Narration,,0,0,0,,Right now though,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:09.88,Narration,,0,0,0,,Flick has put an
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:11.68,Narration,,0,0,0,,exceptional mover where
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:12.58,Narration,,0,0,0,,one step can change
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:13.02,Narration,,0,0,0,,a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:14.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,So when the next
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:15.50,Narration,,0,0,0,,centre back checks over
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:16.30,Narration,,0,0,0,,his shoulder, the question
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:16.88,Narration,,0,0,0,,is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:18.42,Narration,,0,0,0,,Does he follow Raphinha
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:19.94,Narration,,0,0,0,,or protect the space
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.08,Narration,,0,0,0,,Raphinha is about to attack?
